Z||000010||turbo86se||01-06-2001||11:37 AM||||Don't forget about the fuel pump! You'll need the fuel pump from a V6 car. The 4-cyl pump can't feed the thirsty V6 adequately enough!<P>Drat! I had a good '85 SEV6 parts car, why didn't I grab the radiator? <P>tgowens, how much are V6 auto radiators running these days? I may need one for my V6 swap. It's going in an '88 coupe. TIA!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=226077&a=1676320&p=20236791"> ||||reg||1
